meta {
  name: Customer Login After Delete (error)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "email": "{{customerEmail}}",
    "password": "{{customerPassword}}"
  }
}

docs {
  Após DELETE /me, login com as credenciais antigas devolve 401
  INVALID_CREDENTIALS — o use case filtra customers com isDeleted()
  no findByEmail antes de comparar a senha (que foi anulada de
  qualquer maneira).
}
